From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:08:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): a newer model pick supersedes the stored pick

sessions.newest_pick_supersedes (false = off): a model pick settles the pick still stored for its session. A pick that is asked replaces it, so a viewer that attaches is asked about the newest; one that is refused as unresolvable or resets to the default clears it; the confirm token of a replaced or cleared pick is refused with pick_superseded. Before, an older guarded pick stayed stored and was asked again on attach, and its token still committed it.
